4
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,990
So what if you have bodyguards? Times have changed.

5
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:14,910
Just use the beauty machine

6
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:17,790
Even if we are just locked up for a few months, it is absolutely impossible to spend time with our family.

7
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,350
Promise Shu Wan to associate with such people

8
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:20,790
Low risk, high return

9
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:21,750
Besides, the person I'm looking for

10
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:23,030
Still a biological mother

11
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,830
Li Che, you can bear it

12
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:27,230
That wait a minute

13
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:28,670
Can I add Fetion?

14
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:39,620
This shouldn't be considered a leak, right?

15
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,070
Brother Wang Sister Su

16
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:43,630
Pack your things and head home
